SUMMARY:Rosicrucian Exercises: A Foundation for Daily Living VI
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nThe studies of the Rosic
 rucian Order\, AMORC systematically guide us in developing Self-Mastery an
 d ways to be of service. Part of this process is the crucial practice of t
 he Rosicrucian exercises. We will do some of these mystical and related ex
 ercises in an integrated manner including meditation\, visualization\, met
 aphysical aid\, and more. Hugh McCague will guide us through this series o
 f exercises in an educational\, enriching\, and rejuvenating way for our e
 xperience of the Rosicrucian teachings as the foundation for our daily liv
 ing.\n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE be
 low.**
