SUMMARY:Overcoming Fear on the Path of Self-Mastery
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nIn the April 1936 issue 
 of the Rosicrucian Digest there was a very helpful and liberating article 
 by Past Imperator H. Spencer Lewis entitled “Does Fear Enslave You?” W
 e will follow up on that article and consider ways\, known and unknown to 
 us\, that fear may be holding us back in growing and enjoying life. Overco
 ming fear is one of the major ways we mature\, heal\, have greater meaning
  and purpose in life\, and become fully ourselves. Join Hugh McCague as we
  continue to explore Rosicrucian laws and principles and their creative ex
 pression and application for the mastery of life\, harmonious living\, and
  service.\n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLI
 NE below.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31685
 5734/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261005T161532Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261005T161532Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
